            "line": 502,
            "text": "theorem angularLag_lower (c : Parameters) {h η y T : ℝ} (hh : 0 ≤ h)\n    (hh1 : h ≤ 1 / 100) (hy : 0 ≤ y) (hyT : y ≤ T) (hη : |η| ≤ 1)\n    (hhT : h ≤ Real.exp (-(T + 3 / 5)) / 8) :\n    coneFloor * (η ^ 2 + Real.exp (-y)) ≤ angularLag c h η y"
